# Tests

Jest on the frontend and the backend. Statement, branch, function, and line coverage stay above 80%, and the README records the numbers.

Frontend: React Testing Library and MSW. Tests run with `NODE_OPTIONS='--experimental-vm-modules'`. Cover Luhn, CVV, expiry, Visa/Mastercard brand detection, the transaction body (token, no `number` or `cvc`), and the three outcomes.

Backend: one test per use case, with the success Result and the failure Result. Do not call the real gateway; use a fake port.

```ts
// ❌ expect(body.number).toBe('4242…')
// ✅ expect(body.cardToken).toBe('tok_approved')
//    expect(body).not.toHaveProperty('cvc')
```
